 \ReviewerComment{e. ERA5 data retrieved 4 times a day at 00h, 06h, 12h and 18h show instantaneous values for some variables (such as 2-m temperature, wind components, total cloud cover, etc.) but accumulated values over the past hour for others (such as precipitation, large-scale precipitation, etc.) or even maximum/minimum values over the past hour for some others (precipitation rates). How do you consider these distinctions while modeling?}
 
